flowchart TD
  A[Research information] --> B{Consent?}
  B -->|No| X[End research path + non-research option information]
  B -->|Yes| C[Choose non-identifying Participant ID + select Python/Java]
  C --> D[Server generates Private Access Key and signs participant in]
  D --> E[Language-tailored pre-survey]
  E --> F[Practice environment demo]
  F --> G[Confirm selected programming language]
  G --> H[Primary modality · Question 1]
  H --> I[Primary modality · Question 2]
  I --> J[Second modality · Question 3]
  J --> K[Third modality · Question 4]
  K --> L[Language-tailored post-survey]
  L --> M[Incentive]
  M --> N[Completion + return instructions]
  H & I & J -. score + response .-> R[Supabase research records]
  K -. score + response .-> R
  E & L -. survey responses .-> R
  B -. signed consent .-> Q[Restricted encrypted consent record]
  M -. compensation contact .-> P[Restricted encrypted compensation record]
